## 11. Testing plan

| Risk | Test |
|------|------|
| Fees / gas post-subsidy | Cost model A/B with subsidized vs paid gas |
| Token taxes | Fork sims with known tax tokens |
| Latency / FCFS | Measure submit→inclusion distribution; no priority-fee fantasy |
| Failed txs | Nonce stuck, OOG, revert handling |
| Slippage | Partial fill / price move between approve and send |
| Survivorship bias | Include delisted/rugged tokens in score backtests |
| E